{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-04-25 06:20:00', 'title': 'LINDE TO INCREASE HELIUM SUPPLY IN THE U.S.', 'text': "WOKING, UK / ACCESSWIRE / APRIL 25, 2022 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN)(FWB:LIN) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED A NEW LONG-TERM HELIUM OFF-TAKE AGREEMENT TO RECOVER THE HELIUM CONTAINED IN FREEPORT LNG'S PRODUCTION SITE IN TEXAS. LINDE WILL ALSO CONSTRUCT A NEW HELIUM PROCESSING PLANT IN FREEPORT TO PURIFY AND LIQUIFY THE RECOVERED HELIUM, SECURING AN ADDITIONAL SOURCE OF LIQUID HELIUM IN THE U.S. THE HELIUM WILL BE SUPPLIED TO LINDE'S CUSTOMERS ACROSS VARIOUS END MARKETS INCLUDING AEROSPACE, ELECTRONICS, HEALTHCARE AND MANUFACTURING, WHICH CONTINUE TO DEMONSTRATE STRONG DEMAND BOTH IN THE U.S. AND ABROAD."}